@startuml HU14_Observabilidad_secuencia
title HU-14 — Dashboard de observabilidad\nHealth Endpoint Monitoring (Release 02 · DeFi360)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Admin / SM"                       as Admin
boundary    "Frontend (React)"                 as UI
control     "metricsController"                as MC
participant "protect + authorize('admin')"     as MW
participant "MetricsService"                   as MS
participant "priceOracle\nCircuitBreaker + Cache" as ORA
participant "rateLimiter"                       as RL
participant "DatabaseConnection (Singleton)"    as DBC
database    "PostgreSQL\n(loans, liquidations,\nnotifications)" as DB

autonumber

note over MC, MS
  Health Endpoint Monitoring (patrón cloud):
  /health = liveness (sin deps), /ready = readiness (DB + oráculo),
  /metrics = agregado (protegido por RBAC admin).
end note

== Liveness ==
Admin -> UI : Panel de salud
UI -> MC : GET /api/health
MC -> MS : getHealth()
MS --> MC : { status:'ok', uptime, timestamp }
MC --> UI : 200 (sin verificar dependencias)

== Readiness ==
UI -> MC : GET /api/ready
MC -> MS : getReadiness()
activate MS
MS -> DBC : sequelize.authenticate() (ping)
DBC -> DB : SELECT 1
DB --> DBC : OK
DBC --> MS : db: 'up'
MS -> ORA : getState() (circuit breaker)
ORA --> MS : { state:'CLOSED' }
MS --> MC : { db:'up', oracle:'CLOSED' }
deactivate MS
MC --> UI : 200 / 503 según dependencias

== Métricas (admin) ==
UI -> MW : GET /api/metrics (JWT admin)
MW -> MC : authorize('admin') -> next()
MC -> MS : getMetrics()
activate MS
MS -> ORA : getStats() (cache hitRate)
ORA --> MS : { hits, misses, hitRate }
MS -> ORA : getState() (breaker)
ORA --> MS : { state, failureCount }
MS -> RL : getStats()
RL --> MS : { throttled, windowMs }
MS -> DB : COUNT loans GROUP BY status
DB --> MS : { active, paid, defaulted, liquidated }
MS -> DB : COUNT notifications / liquidations
DB --> MS : conteos
MS --> MC : { cache, breaker, rateLimit,\n loansByStatus, notifications, liquidations }
deactivate MS
MC --> UI : 200 (<100 ms)  (escenario de calidad 6)

note over Admin, DB
  /metrics requiere rol admin (HU-13). QA: MetricsService.test.js
  (health vivo, readiness deps, métricas agregadas).
end note

@enduml
